{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2022-07-21 06:15:00', 'title': 'EQUIFAX TO ACQUIRE LAWLOGIX', 'text': "ACQUISITION OF I-9 AND IMMIGRATION CASE MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE PROVIDER TO FURTHER EXPAND EQUIFAX WORKFORCE SOLUTIONS BUSINESS ATLANTA , JULY 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EQUIFAX ® (NYSE: EFX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE LAWLOGIX, A LEADING PROVIDER OF CLOUD-BASED I-9 SOFTWARE AND IMMIGRATION CASE MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE, FROM HYLAND. THIS ACQUISITION WILL ENABLE EQUIFAX'S LARGEST AND FASTEST-GROWING BUSINESS, WORKFORCE SOLUTIONS, TO SUPPORT EMPLOYERS AND LAW FIRMS WITH AN EVEN MORE COMPREHENSIVE SET OF SERVICES AS THEY MANAGE AMIDST TODAY'S COMPLEX AND RAPIDLY CHANGING EMPLOYMENT AND REGULATORY LANDSCAPE."}